  "description": "Asgard Office (Sága) — expert-level document work across Word, PowerPoint, Excel, and PDF. Markdown-spec builds for .docx/.pptx/.xlsx, read-back to Markdown or JSON, placeholder filling into files somebody else designed, a user-composable template registry (project, global, bundled), twenty document genre skeletons, and a static delivery gate that proves overflow, off-canvas shapes, contrast, dangling package relationships, unresolved placeholders, and spreadsheet formula faults without opening Office. Pure Python: no LibreOffice, pandoc, or Office install needed to build, read, or verify. Rendering to PDF and page images stays an explicit external gate.",
